Warrant Purchase Price</U>&rdquo; equals $[&nbsp;&nbsp; ], subject to adjustment for reverse and forward stock splits, stock dividends, stock combinations
and other similar transactions of Ordinary Shares that occur after the date of this Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Per Share
Purchase Price</U>&rdquo; equals US$[ &nbsp;&nbsp;], subject to adjustment for reverse and forward stock splits, stock dividends, stock combinations
and other similar transactions of the Ordinary Shares that occur after the date of this Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Person</U>&rdquo;
means an individual or corporation, partnership, trust, incorporated or unincorporated association, joint venture, limited liability company,
joint stock company, government (or an agency or subdivision thereof) or other entity of any kind.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Placement
Agency Agreement</U>&rdquo; means the placement agency agreement entered into by and between Maxim Group LLC and the Company on March&nbsp;[
 &nbsp;&nbsp;], 2023.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Placement
Agent</U>&rdquo; means Maxim Group LLC.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>PRC</U>&rdquo;
means People&rsquo;s Republic of China.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>PRC Entities</U>&rdquo;
means, collectively, the PRC Subsidiary, the VIEs and the VIE Subsidiaries.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>PRC Overseas
Investment and Listing Regulations</U>&rdquo; shall have the meaning assigned to such term in Section&nbsp;3.1(A)(m).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>PRC Subsidiary</U>&rdquo;
means Recon Hengda Technology (Beijing) Co.,&nbsp;Ltd. a wholly-owned foreign enterprise formed under the laws of the PRC.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Pre-Funded
Warrant Subscription Amount</U>&rdquo; means, as to each Purchaser, the aggregate amount to be paid for the Pre-Funded Warrants purchased
hereunder as specified below such Purchaser&rsquo;s name on the signature page&nbsp;of this Agreement and next to the heading &ldquo;Pre-Funded
Warrant Subscription Amount,&rdquo; in United States dollars and in immediately available funds.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>Pre-Funded
Warrants</U>&rdquo; means collectively, the pre-funded Ordinary Share purchase warrants issued or issuable to certain Purchasers pursuant
to this Agreement in a number equal to such Purchaser&rsquo;s Pre-Funded Warrant Subscription Amount divided by the Per Pre-Funded Warrant
Purchase Price at the Closing in accordance with Section&nbsp;2.2(a)&nbsp;hereof, which Pre-Funded Warrants shall be exercisable immediately
and shall be in the form of <U>Exhibit&nbsp;B</U> attached hereto.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>




<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

