<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<U>VIE Structure</U>&rdquo;
and &ldquo;<U>VIE Structuring Documents</U>&rdquo; shall have the meaning ascribed to such terms in Section&nbsp;3.1(A)(b).</P>

